files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/69e29b7a0d4b4bc1e5591eea_Halcyon-blog-hero-Trivy-supply-chain-security-1200x630-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/69e29b7a0d4b4bc1e5591eea_Halcyon-blog-hero-Trivy-supply-chain-security-1200x630-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/69e29b7a0d4b4bc1e5591eea_Halcyon-blog-hero-Trivy-supply-chain-security-1200x630-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/69e29b7a0d4b4bc1e5591eea_Halcyon-blog-hero-Trivy-supply-chain-security-1200x630-p-2000.jpg 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/69e29b7a0d4b4bc1e5591eea_Halcyon-blog-hero-Trivy-supply-chain-security-1200x630.jpg 2400w\" class=\"cms-card_image\"></div></div><div class=\"cms-card_meta-wrapper\"><div fs-cmsfilter-field=\"date\" class=\"text-style-date text-color-blue\">Apr 17, 2026</div><div class=\"category-link is-outline\"><div fs-cmsfilter-field=\"category\">Industry</div></div></div><div class=\"cms-card_title-link\"><h3 fs-cmsfilter-field=\"title\" class=\"heading-style-cms-card\">Lessons from a Supply Chain Security Event: Responding Effectively </h3></div><div class=\"cms-card_description\"><p fs-cmsfilter-field=\"description\" class=\"text-size-small truncate\">In March 2026, a supply chain compromise affecting Trivy put Halcyon within scope. No unauthorized access was found, but the response surfaced key lessons: assume exposure early, rotate credentials by default, isolate affected components, and treat every incident as a security design review.</p></div><div class=\"cms-card_button-wrapper\"><div data-w-id=\"7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113ec\" class=\"button-secondary\"><div>Read the Blog</div><div class=\"button-secondary-icon-wrap\"><div data-w-id=\"7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113ef\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\" class=\"button-secondary-icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M1.00066 6.00001H10.3563M10.3563 6.00001L5.67847 10.6778M10.3563 6.00001L5.67847 1.32221\" stroke=\"currentcolor\" stroke-width=\"1.34566\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></div><div data-w-id=\"7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113f0\" style=\"transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\" class=\"button-secondary-icon is-absolute w-embed\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M1.00066 6.00001H10.3563M10.3563 6.00001L5.67847 10.6778M10.3563 6.00001L5.67847 1.32221\" stroke=\"currentcolor\" stroke-width=\"1.34566\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></div></div></div></div></a>","link":"https://www.halcyon.ai/blog/lessons-from-a-supply-chain-security-event-responding-effectively","retrieved":1776384000000},{"title":"Your Cloud Doesn't Protect You from Ransomware","contents":"<a id=\"w-node-b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d-bedec3de\" data-w-id=\"b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d\" data-wf-native-id-path=\"b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d_instance-4\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"b2fdc094-047f-c870-a23f-981d2fce238d\" data-wf-cms-context=\"%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%226568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3c5%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2269e0fc4e7d3661eb6c6731bf%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/blog/your-cloud-doesnt-protect-you-from-ransomware\" class=\"cms-card_item is-blog w-inline-block\"><div class=\"cms-card_image-link\"><div class=\"cms-card_image-wrapper is-blog\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/69e0fc7dd509381993169543_Halcyon-blog-hero-Your-Cloud-Doesn%27t-Protect-You-from-Ransomware-1200x630.jpg\" loa