69543_Halcyon-blog-hero-Your-Cloud-Doesn%27t-Protect-You-from-Ransomware-1200x630-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/69e0fc7dd509381993169543_Halcyon-blog-hero-Your-Cloud-Doesn%27t-Protect-You-from-Ransomware-1200x630-p-2000.jpg 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/69e0fc7dd509381993169543_Halcyon-blog-hero-Your-Cloud-Doesn%27t-Protect-You-from-Ransomware-1200x630.jpg 2400w\" class=\"cms-card_image\"></div></div><div class=\"cms-card_meta-wrapper\"><div fs-cmsfilter-field=\"date\" class=\"text-style-date text-color-blue\">Apr 16, 2026</div><div class=\"category-link is-outline\"><div fs-cmsfilter-field=\"category\">Research</div></div></div><div class=\"cms-card_title-link\"><h3 fs-cmsfilter-field=\"title\" class=\"heading-style-cms-card\">Your Cloud Doesn't Protect You from Ransomware</h3></div><div class=\"cms-card_description\"><p fs-cmsfilter-field=\"description\" class=\"text-size-small truncate\">Organizations assume cloud migration transfers ransomware risk. It doesn't. Attackers compromise endpoints, harvest credentials and session tokens, then let cloud sync propagate encrypted files across the entire organization in real time.</p></div><div class=\"cms-card_button-wrapper\"><div data-w-id=\"7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113ec\" class=\"button-secondary\"><div>Read the Blog</div><div class=\"button-secondary-icon-wrap\"><div data-w-id=\"7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113ef\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\" class=\"button-secondary-icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M1.00066 6.00001H10.3563M10.3563 6.00001L5.67847 10.6778M10.3563 6.00001L5.67847 1.32221\" stroke=\"currentcolor\" stroke-width=\"1.34566\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></d